  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Event information for a wide range of activities in our region such as: festivals/fairs, film/new media, galleries, heritage and traditions, literary, museums, music, performance/theatre, seasonal celebrations, special events, sports/outdoors, and tours. <br /><br />\n<u><strong>API's</strong></u><div>Each of the following links provides specific event information. </div><div><br />\n\n<div>Event Categories: <a href='http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/categories.xml' rel='nofollow ugc' target='_blank'>http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/categories.xml </a><br /><br />\nEvent Options: <a href='http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/eventOptions.xml' rel='nofollow ugc' target='_blank'>http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/eventOptions.xml </a><br /><br />\nLocations: <a href='http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/venues.xml' rel='nofollow ugc' target='_blank'>http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/venues.xml </a><br /><br />City Sectors: <a href='http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/citySectors.xml' rel='nofollow ugc' target='_blank'>http://app06.ottawa.ca/online_services/opendata/data/spotlight/citySectors.xml </a><br /><br />\n<strong>Accuracy</strong>: n/a\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Update Frequency</strong>: Updated daily at 12:30 pm\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Contact</strong>: <a href='mailto:Delores.MacAdam@ottawa.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>Delores MacAdam</a></div></div>"
